# Commit finished client work

Work you just finished in Apachiy-NuvioFork (TV) or Apachiy-DesktopMobile (desktop and mobile) gets committed before you stop, switch branches, or hand the tree back.

- Stage only the files from that change. Leave unrelated dirty files alone.
- One commit per change. Do not mix a flavor move with a sync fix.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, APKs, or build logs.
- If the task lives on another branch, commit it on that branch before checking it out.
- Say the commit subject when you finish. A dirty tree you changed is not done.
